unity back onto  its feet the rubble is being cleared  unsafe buildings are being demolished  and power and communication lines are  being repaired and yet against all of  this there is still the uncertainty that  this nightmare is far from over  out there in the Sunda Strait is anak  Krakatau with a volcano that triggered  this tsunami and it still casts a  deathly shadow over this region  this is the third natural disaster to  hit this nation in the last five months  alone Indonesia and her people continue  to suffer so much misery simply for  existing where they do  Ashish Joshi Sky News Indonesia
 

